WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:08.205
Beauty slowly blinked her eyes open.

2
00:00:08.206 --> 00:00:12.017
"What happened?" she thought.

3
00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:14.901
She was lying on a narrow bed.

4
00:00:14.902 --> 00:00:19.224
Everything was foggy, and her head hurt.

5
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:21.476
Beauty stood up.

6
00:00:21.477 --> 00:00:25.391
She was inside a dark, dirty cell.

7
00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:29.149
Suddenly she felt cold and scared.

8
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:33.309
"What is this place?" she whispered.

9
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:40.079
"It's my dungeon!" someone growled.

10
00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:45.143
An ugly beast with sharp fangs stood outside the cell.

11
00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:50.307
Beauty jumped back. "You're the forest monster!"

12
00:00:50.308 --> 00:00:54.621
"You're the monster!" he snapped.

13
00:00:54.622 --> 00:00:59.021
"You stole from my garden.

14
00:00:59.022 --> 00:01:02.758
Now you must pay!"

15
00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:07.373
Beauty fought back tears. "Please don't hurt me.

16
00:01:07.374 --> 00:01:10.528
I was looking for my father.

17
00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:13.919
I followed my friend into your garden.

18
00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:27.579
I was hungry, so . . ."

19
00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:33.354
The beast stroked his mane. "Your father?"

20
00:01:33.355 --> 00:01:36.006
"Yes," Beauty said.

21
00:01:36.007 --> 00:01:40.182
"I think he got lost in the forest."

22
00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.753
She shrank back as the beast stared at her.

23
00:01:43.754 --> 00:01:47.639
He seemed to be thinking about something.

24
00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:52.007
"I'm worried Father is hurt," Beauty said.

25
00:01:52.008 --> 00:01:55.353
"I love him so much!"

26
00:01:55.354 --> 00:02:03.389
"Love! Bah!" Beast stormed out.

27
00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:11.734
Beauty started to sob.

28
00:02:11.735 --> 00:02:16.337
"I'll never see Father again," she thought.

29
00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:22.509
She wept loudly.

30
00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:26.566
But then came a familiar voice from another cell.

31
00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:28.764
"Beauty?"

32
00:02:28.765 --> 00:02:36.952
Beauty gasped. "Is that you, Father?"

33
00:02:36.953 --> 00:02:43.821
They both cried.

34
00:02:43.822 --> 00:02:50.749
Later the beast stomped back in.

35
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.482
"This is your daughter?"

36
00:02:53.483 --> 00:02:56.887
"Yes," Father said.

37
00:02:56.888 --> 00:03:00.550
"I've been thinking," the beast said.

38
00:03:00.551 --> 00:03:04.993
"I'll let you go home, old man."

39
00:03:04.994 --> 00:03:11.142
"Thank you!" Father fell to his knees.

40
00:03:11.143 --> 00:03:13.477
"When can we leave?"

41
00:03:13.478 --> 00:03:15.776
The beast growled.

42
00:03:15.777 --> 00:03:20.025
"She will stay here to complete your punishment."

43
00:03:20.026 --> 00:03:23.504
Father jumped up. "Never!

44
00:03:23.505 --> 00:03:27.196
Release her and I will stay."

45
00:03:27.197 --> 00:03:32.288
"I make the rules here!" the beast shouted.

46
00:03:32.289 --> 00:03:35.596
His ring glowed.

47
00:03:35.597 --> 00:03:39.930
Poof! Father disappeared.

48
00:03:39.931 --> 00:03:45.956
Beauty was all alone with the beast!

